*Output*background:     #0d111a
*Output*foreground:     #e2e8f5
*Output*font:           courier-12
*text*background:       #0d111a
*text*foreground:       #e2e8f5
*text*font:             courier-12
*Text*background:       #0d111a
*Text*foreground:       #e2e8f5
*Text*font:             courier-12
*Text_Display*background: #0d111a
*Text_Display*foreground: #e2e8f5
